        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubbed</strong> is a chaotic online party game inspired by mini-golf — where all players hit at the same time… on the same course. <strong>Collisions guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No turn-based nonsense here: everyone plays simultaneously in a physics-based arena where <strong>skill and chaos go hand in hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends across multiple game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Golf Mode</strong> – Sink all the holes before your opponents<br>🏃 <strong>Race Mode</strong> – Pass every checkpoint in order as fast as you can<br>🎯 <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> – Hold the flag to score points and win the match<br>💥 <strong>Deathmatch Mode</strong> – Avoid traps and explosions, and outlast your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fun, dynamic ball physics<br>🎱 A unique shot system inspired by croquet<br>🧢 Customize your ball with skins, hats, sounds, and more<br>🤖 Add bots to fill your games or practice solo  <br>🌐 Online multiplayer for up to 12 players <br>🎁 <strong>Pick up offensive and defensive power-ups</strong> to cause chaos or protect yourself <br>📈 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> to compare your scores with the world (or just your friends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for quick fun with friends or fierce competition, <strong>Clubbed</strong> delivers <strong>fast-paced, unpredictable, and endlessly replayable matches</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubbed</strong> is a chaotic online party game inspired by mini-golf — where all players hit at the same time… on the same course. <strong>Collisions guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No turn-based nonsense here: everyone plays simultaneously in a physics-based arena where <strong>skill and chaos go hand in hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends across multiple game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Golf Mode</strong> – Sink all the holes before your opponents<br>🏃 <strong>Race Mode</strong> – Pass every checkpoint in order as fast as you can<br>🎯 <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> – Hold the flag to score points and win the match<br>💥 <strong>Deathmatch Mode</strong> – Avoid traps and explosions, and outlast your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fun, dynamic ball physics<br>🎱 A unique shot system inspired by croquet<br>🧢 Customize your ball with skins, hats, sounds, and more<br>🤖 Add bots to fill your games or practice solo  <br>🌐 Online multiplayer for up to 12 players <br>🎁 <strong>Pick up offensive and defensive power-ups</strong> to cause chaos or protect yourself <br>📈 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> to compare your scores with the world (or just your friends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for quick fun with friends or fierce competition, <strong>Clubbed</strong> delivers <strong>fast-paced, unpredictable, and endlessly replayable matches</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "A chaotic online mini-golf party game where everyone plays at the same time! Simultaneous shots, collisions, multiple game modes, and full ball customization.",
